{%- comment -%}
  Paste your CURRENT Shopify order confirmation template here, then run:

    npm run email:merge

  Get it from: Shopify admin → Settings → Notifications → Order confirmation
  → Edit code → select all in the Email body box → copy → replace this file.

  The merge writes docs/order-confirmation.merged.liquid with the ticket QR
  block already in the right place. Copy that back into Shopify.
{%- endcomment -%}
